OL,3,GNEWSAPlea for funding for popular
OL,4,Adisabled dance school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disabled-led dance school is
OL,7,Fstruggling to keep running because of
OL,8,Fhidden costs and a lack of funding.
OL,10,FKate Stanforth set up the Kate
OL,11,FStanforth Academy of Arts, working with
OL,12,Fdancers with a wide variety of
OL,13,Fdisabilities and access requirements,
OL,14,Fduring the pandemic, streaming classes
OL,15,Fonline for free.
OL,17,FThe 32-year-old, from Northumberland,
OL,18,Fsaid the classes were so popular she
OL,19,Fcarried on, with the academy becoming a
OL,20,FCommunity Interest Company (CIC) in
OL,21,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
